<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's CGD lowers prime rate to 9.75 pct.</title>
<headline>Portugal's CGD lowers prime rate to 9.75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Caixa Geral de Depositos (CGD) said it was lowering its variable prime rate 0.125 points to 9.75 percent.</p>
<p>The new rate will be effective from September 23.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
